um.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6042_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-15T14:49:54-08:00","id":1032334,"title":"","content":"One of the interesting things about the Edimmu is that they may have survived. I imagine their 'place' has been taken up by the strix, but they are a threat that can resurface in modern nights.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-16T00:43:15-08:00","id":1032532,"title":"","content":"Hmm, multiple night horror books for multiple eras might be a bit much to expect.<br /> <br /> Say they consider a night horror: the Sundered World would only be of interest of mage and/or werewolf fans who bought and liked the Sundered World, and not even all of them, that would make that a niche product, let's face it, no matter how much the idea might make you drool.<br /> <br /> Now I could see a book night horror: the dark eras, with a collection of horrors for all the eras, perhaps with sequels if it sold well enough.<br /> <br /> If OP felt more expansive, I could see a collection of night horror books for the different lines.<br /> <br /> Like say, dark eras night horrors: changeling, and then have a collection of things for changeling games in the various dark eras. So like a chapter on stuff Changelings might deal with in a Sundered World game, and then the next chapter stuff for a changeling game in the next dark era, etc, etc.<br /> <br /> I could see that being bought even by people who weren't big fans of dark eras, for whatever reason, because they could take these things and apply them in non dark eras things, with a bit of work, and if you're a fan of a gameline and a fan of the dark eras book, I imagine a book with stuff for whatever splat for all the dark eras would probably sell well on that front too. <br /> <br /> That way the good folks at OP can satisfy &quot;this would be really cool to write about&quot; and &quot;this will bring in some beer and pizza money.&quot; <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-16T01:53:04-08:00","id":1032548,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1030110-night-horrors-dark-eras?p=1032334#post1032334\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One of the interesting things about the Edimmu is that they may have survived. I imagine their 'place' has been taken up by the strix, but they are a threat that can resurface in modern nights.</div> </div> </div> </div>I may only be saying this because I want a 2e writeup of the En; as one who is currently playing one. <br /> <br /> Besides; if the <a href=\"http://www.sacred-texts.com/ane/seven.htm\" target=\"_blank\">Seven Evil Spirits</a> isn't appropriate to this game; I don't know what is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is a remedy for everything but death, a hope for everything but wickedness, and everything will lapse except righteousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6042-manusdomine","name":"ManusDomine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6042_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}